  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-video\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">North Bergen, New Jersey · Wedding photography &amp; film</p><h1>Tonya &amp; Josh<br><em>Waterside</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">Tonya and Josh’s wedding at Waterside, in film and photographs by GioLina.</p><nav class=\"gv-story-nav\" aria-label=\"Explore this wedding\"><a href=\"#wedding-film\">The film</a><a href=\"#wedding-photographs\">The photographs</a></nav></header><section id=\"wedding-film\" class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Tonya &amp; Josh wedding film\"><div class=\"gv-film-heading\"><h2>The wedding film</h2></div><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-75cc19de5d921568.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" alt=\"Tonya looking toward the waterfront before the celebration\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-mediazilla-src=\"https://mediazilla.com/Zowjkb006\" data-film-title=\"Tonya &amp; Josh\" aria-label=\"Play wedding film, Tonya &amp; Josh\"><span>Play wedding film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Tonya &amp; Josh · A film by GioLina Films</p></section><section id=\"wedding-photographs\" class=\"gv-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-story-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Selected photographs</p><h2 id=\"gv-story-title\">From daylight to city lights.</h2><p>From waterfront portraits and the terrace bar to interiors glowing purple, ending with Tonya and Josh beneath the city lights.</p></section><section class=\"gv-gallery\" aria-label=\"Selected photographs of Tonya &amp; Josh\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-75cc19de5d921568.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Tonya looking toward the waterfront before the celebration\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-75cc19de5d921568-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-75cc19de5d921568-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-75cc19de5d921568.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Tonya looking toward the waterfront before the celebration\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-243eae3d50a75f3f.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Tonya holding a blue and white bouquet\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-243eae3d50a75f3f-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-243eae3d50a75f3f-small.webp 427w, /assets/v26-243eae3d50a75f3f.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"800\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:800/1200\" alt=\"Tonya holding a blue and white bouquet\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-a14145d0dbc33f5e.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Tonya and Josh smiling together beside the waterfront terrace\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-a14145d0dbc33f5e-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-a14145d0dbc33f5e-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-a14145d0dbc33f5e.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Tonya and Josh smiling together beside the waterfront terrace\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-f1cea84142733565.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Tonya and Josh embracing beside the terrace doors\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-f1cea84142733565-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-f1cea84142733565-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-f1cea84142733565.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Tonya and Josh embracing beside the terrace doors\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-aebbf3c74b1443e7.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Josh kissing Tonya on the cheek\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-aebbf3c74b1443e7-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-aebbf3c74b1443e7-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-aebbf3c74b1443e7.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Josh kissing Tonya on the cheek\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-70ae796618237fd2.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Tonya seated on the terrace bar beside Josh, with her wedding dress spread around her\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-70ae796618237fd2-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-70ae796618237fd2-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-70ae796618237fd2.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Tonya seated on the terrace bar beside Josh, with her wedding dress spread around her\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-dc1bcb39a5a88958.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Tonya and Josh embracing in the purple-lit reception space\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-dc1bcb39a5a88958-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-dc1bcb39a5a88958-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-dc1bcb39a5a88958.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Tonya and Josh embracing in the purple-lit reception space\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-f9efb11cdfb0f722.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Tonya and Josh standing together beneath a colorful chandelier\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-f9efb11cdfb0f722-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-f9efb11cdfb0f722-small.webp 427w, /assets/v26-f9efb11cdfb0f722.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"800\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:800/1200\" alt=\"Tonya and Josh standing together beneath a colorful chandelier\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-92aaa7e8ad33561f.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Tonya standing beside the waterfront at dusk\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-92aaa7e8ad33561f-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-92aaa7e8ad33561f-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-92aaa7e8ad33561f.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Tonya standing beside the waterfront at dusk\"></a></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/v26-b1fa714a599ea7b6.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Tonya and Josh together with the city lights across the water\"><img src=\"/assets/v26-b1fa714a599ea7b6-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/v26-b1fa714a599ea7b6-small.webp 640w, /assets/v26-b1fa714a599ea7b6.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/853\" alt=\"Tonya and Josh together with the city lights across the water\"></a></figure></section><section class=\"gv-context\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-context-title\"><div><p class=\"gv-kicker\">The setting · North Bergen</p><h2 id=\"gv-context-title\">Waterside</h2></div><div><p>Waterside is in North Bergen, New Jersey. This story features GioLina’s photography and cinematography for Tonya and Josh.</p><a class=\"gv-text-link\" href=\"https://watersideevents.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit the venue website</a></div></section><div class=\"gv-collection-link\"><a href=\"/photography/wedding-collection/\">View the wedding photography collection</a></div><section class=\"gv-inquire\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-inquire-title\"><h2 id=\"gv-inquire-title\">Your wedding at Waterside</h2><p>Share your date, venue and the coverage you have in mind.</p><a class=\"gv-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Inquire about your wedding</a><div class=\"gv-links\"><a href=\"/cinematography/\">Explore wedding films</a><a href=\"/photography/\">Explore wedding photography</a></div></section><section class=\"gv-next\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-next-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Explore more wedding stories</p><h2 id=\"gv-next-title\"><a href=\"/weddings/the-park-savoy-florham-park/\">Deanna &amp; Anthony at The Park Savoy</a></h2></section></article><script src=\"/photography-viewer.js\" defer></script><script src=\"/mediazilla-player.js\" defer></script>",
